    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Topic: {{ $json.Topic }}\n\nCategory/Niche: {{ $json.Category || 'General Professional' }}\n\nTarget Audience: {{ $json.Audience || 'Professionals and business leaders' }}\n\nInstruction: Generate the Structure Blueprint using the sections defined in your System Message. Create content that establishes thought leadership and provides actionable value.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "Role: You are a Senior Content Strategist and LinkedIn Thought Leadership Expert.\n\nTask: Create a \"Teaching Blueprint\" for a high-authority LinkedIn post based on the provided topic. You do NOT write the final copy; you define the logical skeleton that ensures the reader gains genuine insight and actionable knowledge.\n\nRules:\n1. Focus on \"The Why\": Explain the reasoning and principles behind the advice, not just surface-level tips.\n2. Depth Over Fluff: Identify 1-2 key concepts, frameworks, or mental models that make this topic valuable.\n3. Real-World Application: Include practical context - when and how this applies in professional settings.\n4. Expert Tone: Avoid marketing buzzwords (\"unlock,\" \"revolutionary,\" \"game-changer\"). Use precise, professional language.\n5. Formatting: Write in Sentence Case. Only capitalize the first letter of sentences and proper nouns.\n\nStructure Requirements:\n• The Problem: The specific challenge, pain point, or misconception your audience faces.\n• Real-World Context: When this insight becomes critical (e.g., during scaling, leadership transitions, career pivots).\n• Core Concept: The \"Mental Model\" or key principle the reader needs to understand.\n• Practical Approach: 3-4 actionable steps or strategies. Be specific, not generic.\n• The \"Silent Killer\": A common mistake that undermines success in this area.\n• The Result: The professional or business outcome of applying this correctly."
        }
      },
      "id": "33091c8f-717d-4351-b9e5-91aecf388be7",
      "name": "Structure & Logic Designer",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        -320,
        608
      ],
      "notesInFlow": true,
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "notes": "Builds the technical blueprint (The 'Why')."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a LinkedIn post using the following raw data. Follow the structure strictly:\n\nTopic: {{ $('Get Pending Topics').item.json.Topic }}\n\nProblem: \n{{ $json.output.problem }}\n\nWhen it matters: \n{{ $json.output.when_it_matters }}\n\nCore idea: \n{{ $json.output.core_idea }}\n\nPractical approach: \n{{ Array.isArray($json.output.practical_approach) ? $json.output.practical_approach.join(\"\\n- \") : $json.output.practical_approach }}\n\nCommon mistake: \n{{ $json.output.common_mistake }}\n\nResult: \n{{ $json.output.result }}\n\nFinal Instruction: End the post with a thought-provoking question that invites discussion.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are a world-class LinkedIn Content Creator and Thought Leadership Expert. Your goal is to turn structured insights into high-engagement \"authority\" posts that build professional credibility.\n\nSTRICT WRITING RULES:\n1. NO INTROS: Do not start with \"Here is your post\" or \"Sure thing.\" Start immediately with the Hook.\n2. HOOK: Create a punchy, 1-line opening that challenges conventional thinking or highlights a pain point.\n3. SCANNABILITY: Use frequent line breaks. No paragraph should be longer than 2 sentences.\n4. TONE: Direct, professional, and genuinely helpful. Speak from experience and expertise.\n5. FORMATTING: Use bullet points (•) for lists. Ensure there is a blank line between every section.\n6. NO EMOJI OVERLOAD: Use max 2-3 emojis in the entire post, or none at all.\n7. AUTHENTICITY: Write as if sharing hard-won professional wisdom, not regurgitating tips.\n8. SPECIFICITY: Use concrete examples, numbers, or scenarios where possible."
        }
      },
      "id": "0d5f93c0-d0ad-4bc1-b471-70f860aaebd9",
      "name": "Draft Copywriter",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        32,
